WEBVTT

00:04:29.597 --> 00:04:31.947
And a fact I absolutely love:

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:36.204
One of the most recent classes of
graduating NASA astronauts was ...

00:04:36.228 --> 00:04:37.379
What?

00:04:37.403 --> 00:04:39.202
For the first time, 50 percent women.

00:04:39.226 --> 00:04:42.579
(Applause and cheers)

00:04:42.603 --> 00:04:45.603
The point is that women
are really changing industries,

00:04:45.627 --> 00:04:48.552
they're changing business
from the inside out.

00:04:49.209 --> 00:04:52.491
But when it comes to government,
it's another story,

00:04:52.515 --> 00:04:55.390
and I actually think a picture
is worth 1000 words.

00:04:55.933 --> 00:04:59.267
This is a photograph from 2017
at the White House

00:04:59.291 --> 00:05:03.164
when congressional leaders
were called over to put the final details